window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The secrets haunting Beau Rochester come alive.</p> <p>He doesn’t deserve happiness, but he holds it in his hands. A woman he loves. A child. The past threatens to rip them away. He risks losing them forever.</p> <p>Jane Mendoza is determined to protect the people she loves from every threat–the mysterious arsonist, the corrupt police force. The darkest danger comes from a place she never expects.</p> <p>She risks more than her newfound family. She risks her life.</p>"; 
